# House Hlaalu: Nileno Dorvayn's later duties, Balmora.
# "Guar Hides" (HH_IndEsp2): Rolasa Oren in Vivec's Foreign Quarter agrees to buy Hlaalu hides (50; SetDisposition
# stands in for persuasion), Nileno pays (100). "Bivale Teneran" (HH_IndEsp3): orders carried to the Ald'ruhn
# clothier ("Give her the scroll." 1: 50), reported (100). "Ralen Hlaalo" (HH_Retaliation): Uryne Nirith describes
# the murderer (50), Thanelen Velas killed (110 at Nileno). "ebony trade" (HH_IndEsp4): Canctunian Ponius in
# Ebonheart convinced (50), reported (100).
# `approach` stands in for the travel (PositionCell first for an unscripted NPC: a non-persistent ref is not found
# while its cell is unloaded); the kill for the fight.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_guar_hides
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask business
ask guar hides
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp2 == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3595 4309 14869 0 "Vivec, Foreign Quarter Upper Waistworks"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Foreign Quarter Upper Waistworks" == 1
approach 05752175
run
"rolasa oren"->SetDisposition 100
talk rolasa oren
ask guar hides
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp2 == 50
bye
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask guar hides
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp2 == 100
bye
end

case hh_bivale
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask business
ask Bivale Teneran
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp3 == 10
expect player->GetItemCount "bk_OrdersForBivaleTeneran" == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell -142 696 -123 0 "Ald-ruhn, Bivale Teneran: Clothier"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ald-ruhn, Bivale Teneran: Clothier" == 1
approach 05C23546
talk bivale teneran
ask scroll
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp3 == 50
bye
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask Bivale Teneran
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp3 == 100
bye
end

case hh_retaliation
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask business
ask Ralen Hlaalo
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Retaliation == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell -310 164 521 0 "Balmora, Hlaalo Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Hlaalo Manor" == 1
approach 05A2C81D
talk uryne nirith
ask Ralen Hlaalo
ask murderer's description
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Retaliation == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 134 233 24 0 "Balmora, Council Club"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Council Club" == 1
approach 05E532E3
defend
console 05E532E3.kill
wait 60
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask Ralen Hlaalo
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Retaliation == 110
bye
end

case hh_ebony_trade
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask business
ask ebony trade
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp4 == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 1091 310 14 0 "Ebonheart, East Empire Company Hall"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ebonheart, East Empire Company Hall" == 1
approach 05BAE9F6
run
"canctunian ponius"->SetDisposition 100
talk canctunian ponius
ask ebony trade
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp4 == 50
bye
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask ebony trade
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp4 == 100
bye
end
